# Server-side values only. In hosted AIW, set these in Sites runtime settings.
# For local use, copy to .env and start with: node --env-file=.env server.js
OPENAI_API_KEY=
AIW_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
# Optional: an OpenAI-compatible gateway instead of api.openai.com (https, or http on loopback only).
# AIW_LLM_BASE_URL=
# Optional, local server only: named accounts so that two people can review each other's knowledge claims
# (four eyes) on one machine. A JSON object of account ID to secret (at least 16 characters each).
# Each person signs in at /local/sign-in. Without it, everyone is the single local architect.
# AIW_LOCAL_ACCOUNTS={"architect":"a-long-private-secret","reviewer":"another-long-private-secret"}
